  "content": "\n\n<p>這個材質包改善了強大 AE 2 模組的貼圖，整體上保留了原始風格（如截圖所示），但許多方塊都獲得了全新材質，色彩更深且風格略有不同，不過我認為效果非常漂亮。一般而言，你可以透過截圖或遊戲內來查看實際呈現效果。<br><br>你可能也會對以下內容感興趣：<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ilaores-tfc-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\">ILAORE's TFC 32x</a>&nbsp;- 32x32 材質包，適用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrafirmacraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraFirmaCraft</a>。<br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/gregtech-revival-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\">GregTech Revival 32x -</a>&nbsp;32x32 材質包，適用於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gregtechceu-modern\" rel=\"nofollow\">GregTechCEu Modern</a>&nbsp;與&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gregtech-ce-unofficial\" rel=\"nofollow\">GregTech CE Unofficial</a>。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gregtechceu-modern\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/improved-create-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\">Improved Create 32x</a> - 32x32 材質包，適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9P3WeQT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1017\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
